 r←AddNofollow_ match;m
⍝ Replacement function for `ResolveReadmeLinks`: puts rel="nofollow noopener" on a link that
⍝ leads away from here, because we are not vouching for wherever a README sends the reader.
⍝ A link that already carries a "rel" is left alone.
 m←match.Match
 r←m
 :If ~∨/'rel='⍷⎕C m
 :AndIf ∨/'href="http'⍷⎕C m
     r←(¯1↓m),' rel="nofollow noopener">'
 :EndIf
